Package: USGSLidarExplorer
Type: Shiny
Title: Explore and Download USGS 3DEP Lidar
Version: 0.2.1
Authors@R: person("Local", "User", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "local@example.invalid")
Description: A local Shiny application for finding USGS 3DEP lidar projects
    that overlap an sf area of interest, selecting individual LAS or LAZ tiles,
    and downloading them with resume, retry, and validation support. It also
    generates 0.5 m canopy height, terrain, and hillshade GeoTIFF products.
License: MIT
Encoding: UTF-8
